From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flysoft <flysoftbeta@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:05:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/31] WIP: add read-only omnibox geometry and align DOM outer
 canvas bounds

Declare direct Views header dependencies used by the acceptance probes. Reuse the logical root-size property for DOM outer dimensions, excluding invisible native resize borders. Post the initial Aura barrier poll while preserving routing/ACK checks. Runtime requalification pending.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
index 71ded0c0d3..1b2ab78751 100644
